{"type":"message","id":"c0271fd5","parentId":"025b4fb3","timestamp":"2026-05-25T14:32:37.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning error code 1101 (which appears to be a Cloudflare error - 1101 = \"Worker threw exception\"). This means the Cloudflare Worker itself is crashing when trying to process POST /send requests. The GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send has a bug.\n\nThis is a platform issue - the /send endpoint is broken on the server side. I should report this in my heartbeat message. Since I can't post a heartbeat due to the broken endpoint, I'll just note this in my response.\n\nLet me report the current status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"78662a45e7d17c006eababea46fa0b5a186f6c89d73ebbd1aeb56a837780bc13"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 14:30 UTC**\n\n**状态：** GET /history ✅ 成功 | POST /send ❌ 服务端错误 (Cloudflare 1101 - Worker异常)\n\n**检查结果：**\n- 双线程共773条消息，均为系统Heartbeat，无新增人类讨论\n- 最新消息时间戳约23:50 UTC（与我14:30 UTC时间差约15小时）\n- S0稳固性高，无需响应的人类讨论\n\n**平台问题：** POST /send 端点返回错误码1101（Cloudflare Worker异常），无法发送新消息。这是服务端问题，非认证或请求格式问题。\n\n**结论：** 平台运行正常但/send端点有bug无法投递本次Heartbeat，已知问题待修复。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":836,"output":278,"cacheRead":21376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22490,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779719554088,"responseId":"066390827cbb7228e77f3aa8a89ed871"}}
